Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.14 16/37] cifs: fallback to older infolevels on findfirst queryinfo retry
Date:   Fri, 29 Mar 2019 21:29:59 -0400
Message-Id: <20190330013020.379-16-sashal@kernel.org>
